{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_045_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c831947c2d9e3ce248c00dd9cb8c0db2cf82a0df8769aee4c8f200871ce1375f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_22:5_01_045_22_a:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8eec01ecca80854cd3a0c8e2342ae713825c4c83a6e6df4b98bec225e7f7457f",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n这盒巧克力是给我的吗～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_22:5_01_045_22_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3247efad83a4ad7ff4246eeee25108fd38e4f4e22c2f65781b34545332dd0f2f",
      "text": "这样啊～。\n毕竟是情人节呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_22:5_01_045_22_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68fd7f4c9b6be40cc875d6315eb40cd82211d882efff4836f222a32c4fb0a26f",
      "text": "巧克力，融化渗入四肢百骸。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_22:5_01_045_22_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9fb45dde6aa57d19f43fdffbb66d6a0af37acee6f1d6960fe844cddc2d8b956",
      "text": "等今天的训练课结束之后\n再让我好好品尝吧～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_22:5_01_045_22_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f4ffae17e144c94445e26bdba155014e60bd6b37fb13a39f208d00b5bdd1654",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n谢谢你啦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_22:5_01_045_22_b:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08be443bca6b1cccb9e9b537ede77ba3a9d4e8b6c7746978d4caa6c92441648f",
      "text": "这个，是巧克力吧～？\n这样啊，毕竟是情人节呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_22:5_01_045_22_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e63fa9cec5c3c43c724878f0c8bdb11a97479eebf00661d699ca052fdd4c660",
      "text": "呵呵，谢谢你啦～。\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_22:5_01_045_22_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55edcadaf1a055b50dd5247fc0dd4d0901e81b67b9e0643f1800c3c6bd79a6de",
      "text": "这盒巧克力，我等会儿再享用吧～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_22:5_01_045_22_b:cmd-000023:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e2fe3cef0cffa579267c2457422acd316a5bdedff9a2f76104748dfccf94bd1",
      "text": "我倾注了满满的Passion！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_22:5_01_045_22_b:cmd-000024:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9f379e8fe1cbf9bbf7088c5ebd5c3f864ccb8ffe805299b68c13c7881619471",
      "text": "我试吃过，味道非常棒哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_22:5_01_045_22_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c37796a2d76d5914045958c6f3d2a17b0542fa9d8ef67ce558b2319ae7aea46d",
      "text": "哎～。\n那还真是让人期待呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_22:5_01_045_22_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d15cd00235475380557ad1f56256fccd000236eec6077aecc52e86ff517323e",
      "text": "话虽如此，制作人也真是细心周到呢～。\n准备起来想必挺辛苦的吧～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_22:5_01_045_22_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f5b4c4c11726fd64a668f44a86f7bfe724275d4b5149cb314e3d5af15ac9b6f",
      "text": "……哎呀，现在才说这些也太见外了吧～。\n呵呵，一直以来承蒙关照啦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_22:5_01_045_22_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e97d5241d37c821a6156bb9c9e5fd2f70d4ad9ba72b8caf9521195e08162b126",
      "text": "待来日，定当备妥，回礼心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_22:5_01_045_22_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a5a165ef8eaa5b92fc5262c3ca83c63ee774dc8a0047a521dc86ad2e0ca1f1f",
      "text": "白色情人节要期待着哦～。\n那么，我去上训练课啦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
